====Usage notes====
The o is occasionally dropped, usually when spelling out words, e.g. "{{l|eo|vu}} {{l|eo|vu}} {{l|eo|vu}}" for "www", or "{{l|eo|vu}} {{l|eo|i}} {{l|eo|ko}} {{l|eo|i}}" for the English word "wiki".

